# core/data/talk/grammar/en/warm_play.tlk - more replies to jokes, laughs, high fives and warm
# greetings (owner: TK; T5b package T5B-WARM). PG-21 for adults means mean-quick comedy, not
# crude: these lines are clean in any room, nothing aimed at a kid, no register word, no
# joke about grief, ghosts' deaths excepted as the game's own gag. One exclamation mark a line
# unless the speaker is loud or a kid. Syntax: core/tools/talkc_gen.py.

# ---- JOKE (the player jokes): laugh ----------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.joke.w_laugh act: laugh
  "Ha! That was good. I'm angry at how good that was."
  "Ha ha! Okay, you got me. Take a bow."
  "Oh no, I laughed. I was trying to keep a straight face."
  "Heh. That one snuck up on me. Nice."
  "Bwah! Do the voice again. The voice was perfect."
  "I snorted. In public. You owe me a tissue."
  "Ha! Hold on, I need to write that down. {.}Nope, forgot it."
  "That's so dumb. I love it. Do another."
  "I'm cackling in my head. It's loud in here."
  "Good one. I'll be laughing about that in the shower."
  "Ha, ha, ha. {.}Okay, that last one was real."
  "Hah! You're a menace. A funny menace."
  "Stop, my cheeks hurt. They're not used to this."
  "Ha! I'm stealing that. I'll say it as my own."
  "Ha! The timing. Chef's kiss, whatever that means."
@rule core.joke.w_laugh_polite guard: polite act: laugh
  "Oh, how delightful. That made me chuckle."
  "What a clever thing to say. You've got a way with words."
  "I do enjoy your wit. It's a pleasure."
@rule core.joke.w_laugh_flat guard: flat act: laugh
  "Ha. {.}That was a laugh. Internal, but hearty."
  "Heh. That was funny. I'm doing a little smile."
  "Good one. I'm laughing. Just in my head."
@rule core.joke.w_laugh_blunt guard: blunt act: laugh
  "Okay, that was funny. Once. Don't push it."
  "Ha. Fine, I laughed. Are you happy?"
@rule core.joke.w_laugh_loud guard: loud act: laugh
  "HA HA HA! Oh, that's GOOD. Tell it AGAIN!"
  "BWAHAHA! Wait, hold on, I need to sit. That was GREAT!"
  "Oh my gosh, I'm DYING. That's the best one yet!"
@rule core.joke.w_laugh_elder guard: elder act: laugh
  "Ha! In my day we only had three jokes. That's a fourth."
  "Oh, that's a good one. I'll save it for the bingo hall."
  "Heh heh. You young ones are quick. I like it."
@rule core.joke.w_laugh_teen guard: teen&!kid_speaker act: laugh
  "Okay, that was actually funny. I'm so mad."
  "Ha, you got me. I give up. {.}Well played."
  "Stop, that's so dumb. Do it again."
@rule core.joke.w_laugh_kid guard: kid_speaker tags: kid act: laugh
  "Ha ha ha! That's the funniest. Tell it to my mom!"
  "Hee hee! I laughed so hard my nose did a thing!"
  "Another one! Another one! Please?"
  "Ha ha! My tummy hurts. The good kind!"
@rule core.joke.w_laugh_happy guard: mood=happy act: laugh
  "Ha! I'm in such a good mood, everything's funny."
  "Oh, that did it. I'm laughing and I can't stop."
@rule core.joke.w_laugh_friend guard: rel=friend act: laugh
  "Ha! You always know how to make me laugh."
  "Of course you'd say that. That's why I like you."
@rule core.joke.w_laugh_hellborn guard: hellborn&!kid_speaker act: laugh
  "Ha! Down in the pit, we call that a good time. Good one."
  "Heh. That's almost as funny as the damned queue. Almost."
@rule core.joke.w_laugh_ghost guard: ghost act: laugh
  "Oooh ha ha! I'm so tickled. I'm going to rattle."
  "That one is gold. {.}Sorry. Old habit."

# ---- JOKE: joke back, tease, dismiss, mock, agree -------------------------------------------
@rule core.joke.w_top act: joke
  "That reminds me of a joke. {.}I forgot it. That's the joke."
  "You think that's funny? Wait till you hear my cousin's."
  "I have a better one. It involves a duck and a loan."
  "Why did the chicken join the band? Because it had the drumsticks."
  "What do you call a sleeping bull? A bulldozer. {.}I'll see myself out."
  "Knock knock. {.}It's the punchline. Let it in."
  "Okay, you're hired. We need more of that."
  "I was going to say that. Then I forgot. Then you said it."
  "Here's a joke. {.}No, it's too good. I'll save it for later."
  "That joke is a lot like my life. Short, and over too soon."
@rule core.joke.w_top_quirky guard: quirky act: joke
  "What did the sock say to the shoe? Nothing, they're both busy."
  "A cloud walked into a bar. It was a mist-take."
  "I once told a joke to a hedge. It's still laughing."
@rule core.joke.w_top_serious guard: serious act: joke
  "That was acceptable. I'll offer a counter, but only a short one."
  "I'm told that was a joke. I will submit a rebuttal in writing."
@rule core.joke.w_top_kid guard: kid_speaker tags: kid act: joke
  "Knock knock, who's there? Boo. Don't cry, it's a joke."
  "What's brown and sticky? A stick! Ha ha ha!"
  "I know a better one! Why did the banana go to the doctor?"
@rule core.joke.w_tease act: tease
  "Did you practice that? I could hear the gears."
  "Hm. Funny for you. Let me check with the other people."
  "I'd laugh harder if you didn't look so proud."
  "That's cute. Did you just think of it, or did it find you?"
  "You think you're funny. And honestly? Fair."
  "Wow. You got that from a cereal box."
  "Nice. Do you have a cousin who does stand-up?"
  "That joke walked so my next joke could run."
@rule core.joke.w_tease_rival guard: rel=rival act: tease
  "Was that a joke? I thought your face just tripped."
  "Ha, ha, ha. {.}There, I laughed. We're even."
@rule core.joke.w_dismiss act: dismiss
  "Boo, bad, terrible. {.}Say it again, though."
  "I'll give that a six out of ten. Maybe a seven."
  "That was a joke? I thought you were clearing your throat."
  "Eh. It's got potential. It needs a nap, and some work."
  "Close. You were so close to funny. Keep trying."
  "Nope. Not today. Come back with a better one."
@rule core.joke.w_dismiss_blunt guard: blunt act: dismiss
  "Nope. Didn't land. Try something else."
  "No. That was bad. Please stop."
@rule core.joke.w_mock act: mock
  "Oh, a comedian! Everybody, we have a comedian. {.}Does anybody want him?"
  "You should do that at open mic. Far, far away."
  "Haha. Hilarious. I'm so impressed I forgot to breathe."
  "Truly, the next generation of comedy is here. Quick, hide."
@rule core.joke.w_agree act: agree
  "That's so true, though. It's funny because it's true."
  "Yes! That's exactly it. You said it better than I could."
  "Ha, you're not wrong. That's the worst part."
  "Right? Somebody had to say it."
  "Honestly, same. {.}That's my life."

# ---- LAUGH (the player laughs): laugh, joke, tease, backchannel, complain --------------------
@rule core.laugh.w_laugh act: laugh
  "Ha ha! Your laugh is contagious. Now I'm doing it."
  "Heh. Okay, it's funny. We're both laughing for no reason."
  "Hee hee! Stop, I can't breathe!"
  "Ha ha ha! Wait, what are we laughing at?"
  "Now you've got me started. Oh dear. {.}Ha ha ha!"
  "Hah! That's the kind of laugh I like. A real one."
  "Ha! I love it when you do that."
  "Oh, we're both gone. Somebody call the laugh police."
  "Hee. It's the best sound. Do it more."
  "Ha ha! Okay, okay. {.}Phew, wow."
@rule core.laugh.w_laugh_flat guard: flat act: laugh
  "Ha. {.}I'm laughing. It's inward, but it's big."
  "Heh. Your laugh is nicer than mine. Mine's a sigh."
@rule core.laugh.w_laugh_loud guard: loud act: laugh
  "HA HA HA! Yes, laugh with me. Louder!"
  "BWAHAHA! Oh my gosh, we're a DUO!"
@rule core.laugh.w_laugh_elder guard: elder act: laugh
  "Ha ha ha! Oh dear, my back. Worth it."
  "Hee hee. Haven't laughed like that since last Thursday."
@rule core.laugh.w_laugh_kid guard: kid_speaker tags: kid act: laugh
  "Hee hee hee! You're funny when you laugh!"
  "Ha ha ha! Do it again, do the snort!"
@rule core.laugh.w_laugh_friend guard: rel=friend act: laugh
  "Ha! It's the best part of my day, laughing with you."
  "We always do this. I love that we always do this."
@rule core.laugh.w_joke act: joke
  "What's so funny? Wait, was it me? It was me, wasn't it."
  "I didn't even say anything and you're laughing. I'm that good."
  "Is it the hat? It's the hat. Everyone laughs at the hat."
  "You laugh like a goose in a hurry. Bless your heart."
  "Hold on, let me get my notes. {.}I think I'm hilarious."
  "Let it out. Laughing is cheaper than therapy."
@rule core.laugh.w_tease act: tease
  "Are you laughing at me, or with me? I need to know."
  "You laughed at your own thing again, didn't you?"
  "That's not a laugh, that's a hiccup with ambition."
  "You do realise I didn't say anything funny?"
  "Okay, go on. Get it out of your system."
@rule core.laugh.w_backchannel act: backchannel
  "Heh. Yeah."
  "Ha. Mm-hm."
  "Right? Good times."
  "Aw, yes. That was fun."
  "Mm. I love a good giggle."
@rule core.laugh.w_complain act: complain
  "Okay, that's enough. I can't breathe. I'm done."
  "My ribs hurt. That's your fault. Send a bill."
  "Stop, stop. I have to stand up. I have to sit down."
  "You're making it worse. I've got hiccups now."

# ---- HIGH_FIVE -------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.high_five.w_back act: high_five
  "High five! {.}Ow. That's a good ow."
  "Up top! Perfect. Whoo!"
  "Smack! Nice one. We're a great team."
  "Yes! Did you hear the clap? That was a pro clap."
  "Gimme five! {.}Gimme another. I like them."
  "Boom. Textbook. We should do this professionally."
  "High five! Wait, I missed. Let's go again."
  "Tap! Nice. That's how it's done."
@rule core.high_five.w_back_flat guard: flat act: high_five
  "Up top. {.}That was my happy slap."
  "Sure. Five. {.}That's me being thrilled."
@rule core.high_five.w_back_loud guard: loud act: high_five
  "WHOOP! HIGH FIVE! That was the BEST one ever."
  "YEAH, BOOM! We're a PAIR of CHAMPIONS!"
@rule core.high_five.w_back_elder guard: elder act: high_five
  "Oh, careful. Gentle. These old hands have seen things."
  "A high five! Haven't had one since the nineties."
@rule core.high_five.w_back_kid guard: kid_speaker tags: kid act: high_five
  "Yay, high five! Now a low five, now a sideways five!"
  "Slap! That was loud. I'm the loudest!"
@rule core.high_five.w_laugh act: laugh
  "Ha! We totally missed. That counts, right?"
  "Ha ha! It felt like clapping in slow motion."
  "Oops, my hand slid. Let's call it a stylish miss."
@rule core.high_five.w_joke act: joke
  "That was a five. This is a five-and-a-half. Ow."
  "Keep your hand up. I'm going for the world record."
  "Nice. I'm putting that on my record. And my wrist."
  "Five! Out of ten, I'd rate us eleven."
@rule core.high_five.w_dismiss act: dismiss
  "Not now, I'm busy. Maybe later. Okay, now."
  "Nope. I'm not in a high five mood. {.}Okay, fine."

# ---- GREET, with warmth ----------------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.greet.w_warm act: greet
  "Hi! There you are! I was hoping you'd come by."
  "Hello, you! It's so good to see you."
  "Well, look who's here. My favourite person today."
  "Hey! Come in, come in. I'm glad you're here."
  "Good to see you! You're looking well. Or at least upright."
  "Hi there! Perfect timing. I was just thinking about you."
  "Oh, hello! You've made my day a little better."
  "Hey, you! Pull up a chair. Or a floor."
  "A friendly face! Be still my heart. Welcome."
  "Hi! I was starting to feel lonely. Now I'm fine."
  "Hello hello! Welcome. Your timing is magical."
  "Hey! I just put the kettle on. Metaphorically."
@rule core.greet.w_warm_polite guard: polite act: greet
  "Good day to you. It's always a pleasure."
  "How lovely to see you. Do come in."
  "Welcome, welcome. I trust you're well?"
@rule core.greet.w_warm_flat guard: flat act: greet
  "Hi. {.}I'm happy to see you. This is my happy face."
  "Hello. Good to see you, I mean it. Look, I'm smiling."
@rule core.greet.w_warm_blunt guard: blunt act: greet
  "Oh, it's you. Good. Sit."
  "There you are. About time. I missed you, so don't say anything."
@rule core.greet.w_warm_loud guard: loud act: greet
  "HEY! It's YOU. I'm so happy to see you I could scream!"
  "HELLO! You came. I'm SO glad you came!"
@rule core.greet.w_warm_elder guard: elder act: greet
  "Ah, there you are, dear. Come, sit, it's nice to see a face."
  "Hello, hello. My old eyes light up when you come in."
@rule core.greet.w_warm_teen guard: teen&!kid_speaker act: greet
  "Hey. Good to see you. Don't make it weird."
  "Oh, hey. Sit down, I'm glad you're here. Whatever."
@rule core.greet.w_warm_kid guard: kid_speaker tags: kid act: greet
  "Hi hi hi! You came! Do you want to play?"
  "Yay, it's you! I made a thing. Come see my thing!"
  "Hello! I was waiting. Look, I'm waiting right now!"
@rule core.greet.w_warm_morning guard: time=morning act: greet
  "Good morning! The day's a little brighter with you in it."
  "Morning! I made coffee, mostly. It's warm water."
  "Good morning, sunshine. Or whatever your weather is."
@rule core.greet.w_warm_evening guard: time=evening act: greet
  "Good evening! Perfect time for a visit."
  "Hello! Come in, the evening's just starting."
@rule core.greet.w_warm_night guard: time=night act: greet
  "Hi. Late visit! I like it, it's cosy at night."
  "Hello, night owl. Come on in, I'm up."
@rule core.greet.w_warm_friend guard: rel=friend act: greet
  "There's my friend! I missed you. A normal amount."
  "Hey, buddy! Get in here. Tell me everything."
  "My favourite friend! No offence to the others."
@rule core.greet.w_warm_best guard: rel=best act: greet
  "My best friend! I was just about to call you."
  "Oh, finally! Now the day can start properly."
@rule core.greet.w_warm_family guard: rel=family act: greet
  "Hi, family! Come in. There's always room."
  "Oh, hello! Home is where you are. Cheesy, but true."
@rule core.greet.w_feeling act: ask_feeling
  "Hi! How are you doing today? Really, how are you?"
  "Hey there. How's your day going so far?"
  "Hello! Is everything good?"
  "Hi, hi. Tell me everything. How are things?"
  "Good to see you. How've you been?"
@rule core.greet.w_joke act: joke
  "Hi! I'd get up, but I'm committed to this chair."
  "Hello! I've been waiting. Time moves slowly in this room."
  "Hey! You're late by my clock. It's a banana."
  "Hi, welcome. Mind the doormat. It judges."
@rule core.greet.w_tell act: tell
  "Hi! I was just thinking about something silly. Want to hear?"
  "Hey! You won't believe my morning. I barely do."
  "Hello! I've got news. Small news, but still."
@rule core.greet.w_tease act: tease
  "Look who finally remembered I exist!"
  "Oh, hello. Did you get lost, or just lazy?"
  "There you are. Do you have an excuse? I'd love one."
